# One *_pricing_cache.json per live-pricing-fetcher gateway provider
# (openrouter, nanogpt, haimaker, opencodezen, groq, and one per provider
# registered from vendor/awesome-free-llm-apis) — a glob instead of hand-
# listing each filename so a newly-registered provider's cache file doesn't
# need a matching .gitignore edit to stay out of git.
*_pricing_cache.json
model_staleness_cache.json
model_catalog_staleness_cache.json
lsp_staleness_cache.json
